menu "Settings (NVS Parameter Store)"

config SETTINGS_SELF_TEST
    bool "Run settings self-test on boot"
    default n
    help
        When enabled, the firmware runs all settings unit tests
        during startup (after settings_init, before protocol stack).
        Results printed via ESP_LOG, final summary line:
        "SELF-TEST DONE: <n>/<total> PASS" (tag: settings_selftest).

        For on-target verification only.  Keep disabled in production.

endmenu
